<title>USA: Dura Automotive completes KPI purchase.</title>
<headline>Dura Automotive completes KPI purchase.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dura Automotive Systems Inc said it completed the previously announced acquisition of KPI Automotive Group from Sparton Corp.</p>
<p>No terms were disclosed.</p>
<p>KPI's operations are headquartered in Grand Haven, Mich. and consist of technical and manufacturing facilities in Indiana and Michigan with about $95 million in annual sales.</p>
<p>Dura designs and manufactures control mechanisms and cable-related systems for the automotive industry.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787)</p>
</text>
